.nh
.TH "GIT-BUG" "1" "Apr 2019" "Generated from git-bug's source code" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
git-bug-bug-select \- Select a bug for implicit use in future commands


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBgit-bug bug select BUG_ID [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Select a bug for implicit use in future commands.

.PP
This command allows you to omit any bug ID argument, for example:
  git bug show
instead of
  git bug show 2f153ca

.PP
The complementary command is "git bug deselect" performing the opposite operation.


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for select


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
git bug select 2f15
git bug comment
git bug status

.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBgit-bug-bug(1)\fP
